    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4793cb635483f2e3418e4a2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "使用「领放」战术取得朝日杯未来锦标、皋月赏、\\n日本德比、第三年日本杯的胜利；\\n基础能力值「速度」和「毅力」均达到1200以上",
      "source_fingerprint": "95ea7ce825c64690881c0fbea79a6c8065228d00b5f8d1316a984ac9f5109097",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "225"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba351eed3eac527681f844fa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "使用「领放」战术以第四或更低人气取得GⅠ胜利；\\n使用「领放」战术取得第三年春季天皇赏、宝冢纪念、有马纪念的胜利；\\n「领放」适性达到S或以上",
      "source_fingerprint": "d14f528c8456eebe27352f330046008b011135cc4cc23f3cf54109c8fd7ab91b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "226"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:803572ff1f6a3e1a24774bf5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在草地和沙土的GⅠ取得四次以上胜利；\\n使用「先行」战术取得东京大赏典、第三年宝冢纪念的胜利；使用「居中」跑法或「追赶」跑法取得春季天皇赏、有马纪念的胜利",
      "source_fingerprint": "2418dc56a6effe2249c1e59b484c82881d76c1a00540578be594f74ab3bf0576",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "227"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae4c7a052e5f4780a8ed6d44",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "使用「追赶」战术取得郁金香赏、秋华赏的胜利；\\n使用「追赶」战术或「居中」战术取得第三年宝冢纪念、伊丽莎白女王杯、有马纪念的胜利",
      "source_fingerprint": "f88504fd12acaa704813c57df09139fcb2ee3dfad29ec1642f01cd4def4d9cf6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "228"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6261ba82f37017bde2a1fb5e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "取得经典三冠（皋月赏、日本德比、菊花赏）、\\n第三年天皇赏春秋连霸（春季天皇赏、秋季天皇赏）、\\n第三年宝冢纪念、第三年有马纪念的胜利；基础能力值「智力」达到1200以上",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f3e6dae7c681f47be157f5b43c2a3455c93a74eea2e1dba9f63cacca565fac2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "229"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:179ff0aec3459f27b834fdc7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在中央10处竞马场各取得一次重赏（G赛）胜利",
      "source_fingerprint": "7df809b7cfd1b6032c55e49b3cab85435104d95dd229b60adc68f6ac01889f8e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "23"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:489836f26b4676a10e69f2de",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "参加重赏比赛达到23次以上，\\n并取得古马级安田纪念、宝冢纪念、\\n短途马锦标（スプリンターズS）、英里冠军赛（マイルCS）的胜利",
      "source_fingerprint": "9de30ad238b942c807b7b020e031078741bca1bf4f0d8275dcc6418971287ee1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "230"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa549a9ce59a606b2cd9b8a7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "至少赢得11次沙土GⅠ；\\n保持「绝佳」状态完成全部赛事并完成育成",
      "source_fingerprint": "35c8a7076ab47acd69e3e8cce7cf56ab32e68ccb7903b4399daf6365417ea1af",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "231"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de484e3e540943c9b9305144",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赢得盛岡竞马场重赏比赛的胜利，\\n赢得樱花赏、日本橡树大赛（オークス）、秋华赏的胜利，\\n粉丝数达到320000人以上",
